          (severity . "blocking")
          (summary . "The 19-file sweep capture's footer said 11 of 19 files with a reported failure while every per-file section above it read 0 failures and 0 errors. The detector matched rackunit's green 0 failure(s) summary line. The capture is SHA256SUMS-bound and is cited by the report, the preflight JSON and the validation record as the substantiation of 0 failures, 0 errors, so on its face it contradicted the claim it was cited for.")
