      (rounds-prior-fix-check . "All twelve prior findings confirmed GENUINELY FIXED. R3-F2 was accepted as substantively fixed but its replacement capture introduced a new defect, which became R4-F1. R3-F4 was accepted as fixed in substance with its self-reference caveat upheld, which became R4-F4. R3-F1 was confirmed fixed, with the reviewer judging the residual gap between b0f19d6bd and the content head to be the unavoidable an-artifact-names-the-tree-it-ran-on consequence rather than the same defect, but noting the validation record's enumeration of that gap was incomplete, which became R4-F2.")
