          (resolution . "FIXED. Reworded to name the three files that actually pin frozen artifacts. The change is comment-only and that is measured, not asserted: the file re-runs through the project runner at 75/75 with exit 0, captured in raw/milestone-gate-recheck.txt. Whether the tier-ownership matrix binds this file's hash was checked BEFORE editing - it records test PATHS and a digest of the families list, not per-file hashes, so a comment change leaves it valid. This is the one round-9 finding that changes the tree under tests/, so both path enumerations and the no-source-change claim are re-derived rather than left standing; they move from 13/14 to 15/16 and the claim is restated precisely.")
          (severity . "minor")
