          (resolution . "FIXED by re-measurement, not by adjustment. All three surfaces now state the measured 6/6 W6, 12/12 W7, 1/1 tier-ownership and 19/19 overall. The deeper point is that the retained chain capture cannot show those numbers: raw/verify-chain.txt records 9/9 and 16/16 because the W7 manifest held nine entries when the chain ran, and re-running the 29-minute chain was not justified for a manifest that grew by adding captures. So the fix states the current totals as measured now and labels the retained output a historical snapshot of its own run, in all three surfaces, instead of silently quoting 16/16 as current or restating a capture that says otherwise. The validation record's capture count is corrected from eight to nine.")
